{"id":"bb4321f7cd8a5eb1","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-encoding-completeness.md","title":"Encoding Completeness","display":"df-encoding-completeness — Encoding Completeness","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-encoding-completeness","aliases":["92-df-encoding-completeness"],"display":"df-encoding-completeness — Encoding Completeness","depends_on":["[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-arithmetization-steps]]","[[92-df-expression]]","[[92-df-signature]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-encoding-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-encoding-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-encoding-completeness — Encoding Completeness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"573d6ccf155d773c\" href=\"?note=573d6ccf155d773c\" title=\"92-df-arithmetization-steps\">92-df-arithmetization-steps</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c56ec2b54fc34fc6\" href=\"?note=c56ec2b54fc34fc6\" title=\"92-df-expression\">92-df-expression</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)\\)</span> (syntactic-object class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c56ec2b54fc34fc6\" href=\"?note=c56ec2b54fc34fc6\" title=\"92-df-expression\">92-df-expression</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c,\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner,\\mathrm{Code}_G\">\\(c,\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner,\\mathrm{Code}_G\\)</span> (Gödel coding, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SeqDec}\">\\(\\mathrm{SeqDec}\\)</span> (sequence decoder on legal codes, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"573d6ccf155d773c\" href=\"?note=573d6ccf155d773c\" title=\"92-df-arithmetization-steps\">92-df-arithmetization-steps</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_G,\\mathrm{Dec}_G,\\mathrm{EncComplete}_G\">\\(C_G,\\mathrm{Dec}_G,\\mathrm{EncComplete}_G\\)</span> (definition targets)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}encoding\\text{-}completeness} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&amp;C_G\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Dec}_G:C_G\\to\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G),\\qquad\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall(q_0,\\ldots,q_{k-1})\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\n\\forall n\\in C_G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{SeqDec}(n)=\\langle q_0,\\ldots,q_{k-1}\\rangle\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Dec}_G(n)\\coloneqq\n\\langle c^{-1}(q_0),\\ldots,c^{-1}(q_{k-1})\\rangle\\Bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{EncComplete}_G(X)\\leftrightarrow X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)\n\\land\\forall E\\in X\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Dec}_G(\\ulcorner E\\urcorner)=E\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathrm{Code}_G(X)\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Dec}_G(n)\\in X\\land\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Dec}_G(n)\\urcorner=n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}encoding\\text{-}completeness} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&amp;C_G\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Dec}_G:C_G\\to\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G),\\qquad\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall(q_0,\\ldots,q_{k-1})\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\n\\forall n\\in C_G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{SeqDec}(n)=\\langle q_0,\\ldots,q_{k-1}\\rangle\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Dec}_G(n)\\coloneqq\n\\langle c^{-1}(q_0),\\ldots,c^{-1}(q_{k-1})\\rangle\\Bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{EncComplete}_G(X)\\leftrightarrow X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)\n\\land\\forall E\\in X\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Dec}_G(\\ulcorner E\\urcorner)=E\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathrm{Code}_G(X)\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Dec}_G(n)\\in X\\land\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Dec}_G(n)\\urcorner=n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>编码完整性</li>\n<li>所有相关语法对象都被编码</li>\n<li>公式、证明、推理规则</li>\n<li>代入、量化、变量</li>\n<li>编码覆盖所需所有操作</li>\n<li>不遗漏关键操作</li>\n<li>这里的“完整”只断言对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 无信息损失：编码与解码在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 及其码像上互逆</li>\n<li>Gödel句子的构造还需要公式识别、代入等语法运算在码层可计算；这些不是本定义自动推出的</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetization-steps","status":"resolved","id":"573d6ccf155d773c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetization-steps]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-expression","status":"resolved","id":"c56ec2b54fc34fc6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","loca